@* Written in each component, not in an _Imports.razor, whose class Razor makes public (ADR-0201).
   This project's root namespace is ExPivot.MudBlazor, where a bare "MudBlazor" resolves to this
   namespace and MudBlazor's Color and Typo vanish (the collision AGENTS.md records for the grid's
   Wrapper): every product using is written with global::. *@
@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components
@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Web
@using global::ExPivot
@using global::ExPivot.Chrome
@using global::ExPivot.Engine
@using global::MudBlazor
@* Not the contract (ADR-0201): MudPivotChrome draws this part, and no Consumer places it. It is
   public only because Razor makes every component public, is hidden from a Consumer's editor, and
   may change in any version. *@
@attribute [System.ComponentModel.EditorBrowsable(System.ComponentModel.EditorBrowsableState.Never)]
@* The Stale Report's notice under MudBlazor (ADR-0062/0067): a warning MudAlert saying what
   happened and the time of the data shown, with a Retry MudButton that asks the source again. It
   stands inside ExPivot's live region under the Pivot Toolbar; MudAlert adds no role of its own, so
   the notice is announced once, politely. Retry is pressed in the pivot's Input Order, through the
   context's InOrder (ADR-0240 section 6). *@
<MudAlert Severity="Severity.Warning" Variant="Variant.Outlined" Dense="true" Class="mud-ex-pivot-stale-notice">
    <div class="mud-ex-pivot-stale-content">
        <span class="mud-ex-pivot-stale-message">@Context.Message</span>
        <MudPivotButton Variant="Variant.Text" Color="Color.Warning" Size="Size.Small" Class="mud-ex-pivot-retry"
                        StartIcon="@Chrome.IconFor(Context.Retry.Id)" Disabled="@(!Context.Retry.Enabled)"
                        OnClick="Context.Retry.Invoke" InOrder="Context.InOrder">@Context.Retry.Label</MudPivotButton>
    </div>
</MudAlert>

@code {
    /// <summary>What to say and whom to call back (ADR-0067).</summary>
    [Parameter, EditorRequired] public PivotStaleReportContext Context { get; set; } = default!;

    /// <summary>The Chrome this notice belongs to.</summary>
    [Parameter, EditorRequired] public MudPivotChrome Chrome { get; set; } = default!;
}
